<title>MOZAMBIQUE: SOCCER-MOZAMBIQUE BEAT MAURITIUS 3-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOZAMBIQUE BEAT MAURITIUS 3-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mozambique beat Mauritius 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in an African Nations Cup group seven qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Chiquinho Conde 55, Sergio Matsolo 62, Andre Macamo</p>
<p>65</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
</text>
